WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.043
It’s the last week of the month.

00:00:02.193 --> 00:00:05.286
Six GCs. Fourteen lien waivers.
One of you.

00:00:05.487 --> 00:00:09.820
One supplier’s waiver shows up late,
and the GC holds your whole draw.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:13.203
The work is done. The money waits.
You float payroll. Again.

00:00:13.603 --> 00:00:15.505
What if none of it was yours to chase?

00:00:16.405 --> 00:00:20.639
Meet OpOrd. We run month-end billing
for commercial subcontractors.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:24.148
On day one, we text your project
managers for their numbers,

00:00:24.148 --> 00:00:26.980
and request every waiver,
on the right form.

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.900
We follow up until each one is back,

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.780
and check every date,
amount, and signature.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.900
Then we build each GC’s package.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.919
You review it, and sign once,
right from your phone.

00:00:36.989 --> 00:00:38.941
Submitted, days before cutoff.

00:00:39.241 --> 00:00:43.249
And when the money lands, we see it,
and line up your unconditional waiver.

00:00:43.549 --> 00:00:45.439
No chasing. No scramble.

00:00:45.439 --> 00:00:48.533
Just complete packages,
out the door before cutoff.

00:00:48.933 --> 00:00:51.422
OpOrd. Get the last week
of the month back.
